4.2 Continual Pre-training (CPT) for Domain Adaptation
Extensive evaluation results of the CPT specifically focusing on the Si ↔ En language pair are detailed in Table 4.
Overall, CPT improves the results compared to both baselines. This clearly illustrates that under-represented languages
