5 DISCUSSION
We explore the effectiveness of mixed precision training, the application of CPT and ITTL techniques, and the role of in
and out-domain data in enhancing translation quality across multiple language pairs. The insights derived from these
evaluations offer valuable directions for optimizing translation models, particularly in resource-constrained settings.
Findings are: (1). Mixed precision training, while delivering similar BLEU scores as full precision training, significantly
